| item 3 — `STATUS-0.8.*.md` glob | 178,264 | 19 files; **18 are CLOSED** |
| item 4 — `plan-0.8.*.md` glob | 115,525 | 20 files; **17 are `status: COMPLETE`** |
| items 5–7 | ~29,000 | orchestration, orchestrator handoff, MEMORY, last report |

