**Finding 2 — its own instrument shows the tree-wide prune did not help this axis.**
63

64
| metric | baseline `25541d88` | post `bb64a2d4` |
65
|---|---|---|
66
| `dev_tree.md_tokens_est` | 3,499,334 | 1,883,557 (**−46 %**) |
